<div class="cell">
<div class="code-copy-outer-scaffold"><div class="sourceCode cell-code" id="cb4" style="background: #f1f3f5;"><pre class="sourceCode r code-with-copy"><code class="sourceCode r"><span id="cb4-1">ks  <span class="ot" style="color: #003B4F;
